content+='''<section id="explore" class="section-pad"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Find your<br><em>streaming moment.</em></h2><p>JioHotstar is a streaming service in JioStar’s portfolio. SonyLIV and ZEE5 are separate services with their own advertising products.</p></div><div class="stream-services"><button data-stream="JioHotstar" aria-pressed="true"><b>✦</b> JioHotstar<small>JioStar</small></button><button data-stream="SonyLIV" aria-pressed="false"><b>▶</b> SonyLIV<small>Sony Pictures Networks India</small></button><button data-stream="ZEE5" aria-pressed="false"><b>◉</b> ZEE5<small>Zee Entertainment</small></button><button data-stream="Prime Video" aria-pressed="false"><b>▶</b> Prime Video<small>Amazon · eligible markets</small></button><button data-stream="Netflix" aria-pressed="false"><b>N</b> Netflix<small>Eligible ad-supported markets</small></button></div><div class="stream-cinema"><div class="cinema-heading"><span id="stream-name">JioHotstar</span><span>CONCEPT PREVIEW · NOT A LIVE STREAM</span></div>'''+creative()+'''<div class="cinema-controls"><span>▷ &nbsp; Advertisement</span><div class="ad-progress"></div><span>Illustrative placement</span></div></div>'''+note('Brand badges are text identifiers, not official partner endorsements. TV and streaming inventory are separate. All streaming connections are planned; availability, territories, ad-supported plans and formats require publisher confirmation.')+cards([('Before the story','Explore pre-roll concepts where the publisher supports them.'),('During the experience','Plan creative for eligible ad breaks, with publisher-specific duration and quality rules.'),('Across devices','Adapt your campaign for connected TV, desktop or mobile without assuming every format is available.')])+'</section>'+cta()
page('streaming','OTT & streaming advertising','Explore streaming advertising concepts for JioHotstar, SonyLIV, ZEE5 and international markets.',content)
content=hero('Social & search','In the feed.<br><em>On their radar.</em>','One creative direction. Different contexts. See how your message can adapt to social feeds, search results and an inbox.','mint')
content+='''<section id="explore" class="section-pad"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Same campaign.<br><em>A fresh perspective.</em></h2><p>Select a placement to see the same fictional brand in a different environment.</p></div><div class="preview-controls digital-controls">'''+''.join(f'<button data-placement="{p}" aria-pressed="{str(i==0).lower()}">{p}</button>' for i,p in enumerate(['Instagram','Facebook','Google','Outlook','TikTok','Snapchat']))+'''</div><div class="digital-preview-grid"><div class="placement-context"><span class="eyebrow" id="placement-owner">META / INSTAGRAM</span><h3 id="placement-title">A moment in their feed.</h3><p id="placement-copy">Bring your story into a visual feed with artwork, a caption and a clear next step.</p><p class="preview-note">Simplified visual examples, not exact platform interfaces or guaranteed placements. Availability depends on country, account eligibility and provider approval. TikTok and Snapchat connections are planned.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@primeboards.in">Discuss your channel mix ↗</a></div><div class="placement-preview" data-placement="Instagram"><div class="placement-header"><strong id="placement-brand">Instagram</strong><span>Concept preview</span></div><div class="inbox-lines"><span>Focused &nbsp; Other</span><p>Your weekly inspiration</p><p>A new collection to discover</p></div><div class="ad-identity"><span>SN</span><div>Studio North<small>Sponsored · Fictional brand</small></div><span>•••</span></div>'''+creative()+'''<div class="search-ad"><small>Sponsored · studionorth.example</small><h3>Studio North — Make room for extraordinary</h3><p>Explore a new perspective on everyday living. Discover the collection.</p></div><div class="social-caption">♡ &nbsp; ◇ &nbsp; ↗<p><b>Studio North</b> A little inspiration for your everyday.</p><span>Discover more ↗</span></div></div></div>'''+note('Outlook illustration represents an advertising-network placement, not an email sent to a user. Delivery on a particular surface is not guaranteed.')+cards([('Meta','Facebook and Instagram are Meta products. Choose compatible formats and account permissions.'),('Google & Microsoft','Search and audience placements have different assets, targeting and delivery requirements.'),('TikTok & Snapchat','Separate platforms and separate integrations. Market availability must be checked before planning.')])+'''<p class="preview-note">Learn about formats: <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/outlook/about-ads-in-outlook">Microsoft Outlook ads</a> · <a href="https://ads.tiktok.com/business/en/guides/types-of-digital-ads">TikTok advertising</a> · <a href="https://forbusiness.snapchat.com/advertising/ad-formats">Snapchat formats</a>.</p></section>'''+cta()
